  "_comment": "Every card in the game. kind: basic (the starting deck), equipment (weapons and armor: gunsmith/armorer sell them, the mechanic upgrades them), ability (trainers teach and train them; also level-up picks and loot), ally (survivors and machines that join the fight: traders sell them, trainers train them), supply (medics and traders sell them), terrain (added to your deck for one fight, from the ground around you; never owned). speed: action (your turn only, the default) or reaction (also in answer to a zombie's move or reaction). target: enemy, all, self, or source (the pack you're answering). levels: the card at level 0, 1 (+) and 2 (++): its energy cost and effects. Card text is written from the effects (server/src/cards.ts describe()). Effects: damage (x hits), damage_all, block, heal, draw, energy, poison, poison_all, weak, weak_all, vulnerable, strength, dexterity, thorns (powers last the fight), self_damage, cleanse, exhaust, counter (reaction, attack or any), ally ({power, toughness, guard, sweep}). flavor: a line under the rules text.",
